[h2]Overview[/h2]

This mod adds a Japanese localization for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2962238514]Search & Trade Artifacts[/url] by [url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/pharaox]pharaox[/url].

It only adds [b]localization/japanese[/b] files — it does not modify or include any of the original mod's scripts, GUI, or content. Enable it after Search & Trade Artifacts in your mod list.

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

You need to subscribe to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2962238514]Search & Trade Artifacts[/url] separately. This mod does nothing on its own.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]

Matches base mod v0.18.0 / CK3 1.20.*. If a newer version of the base mod adds or changes localization keys, some text may temporarily fall back to English until this mod is updated.

